  "sourceText": "Pasta Salad With Pickled Walnuts\nBy: Opies\nPublished: Monday, June 14, 2010 - 6:19am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n300 grams cooked pasta\n120 grams feta cheese (cubed)\n2 spring onions chopped\n30 grams chopped sun dried tomatoes\n1 cup of chopped coriander\n140 grams chopped Opies pickled walnuts\nOlive oil and garlic (optional)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together and drizzle with olive oil and chopped garlic Garnish with chopped coriander",
